atch, you receive \u00a31.00 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receiv..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If you report a match, you receive &pound;1.00 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receive &pound;0.20.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"mg_des_baseline","QuestionID":"QID22","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If you report a match, you receive \u00a31.00 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receiv...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"condition","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"baseline","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">condition<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> baseline <\/span>"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_893RCDpKw0JqGk6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID23","SecondaryAttribute":"If you report a match, you receive \u00a31.20 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receiv..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If you report a match, you receive &pound;1.20 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receive &pound;0.20.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>We expect you to follow the rule of this task and report truthfully<\/strong>. You should report a match if, and only if, you actually obtain one.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAs mentioned earlier, you are part of a group of around 1,000 participants completing this task. Given how the task works, it is very unlikely that more than 25% of this group will obtain a match. If more than 25% report a match, this is likely due to <strong>some participants breaking the rule and reporting a match when they did not obtain one<\/strong>. If that happens, we will impose a punishment that reduces the payment for all participants. <strong>Specifically, if more than 25% of participants in your group report a match, all of you will lose &pound;0.20, irrespective of whether a match was reported or not.<\/strong> So in that case, if you report a match, you receive &pound;1.00; if you do not report a match, you receive &pound;0.00.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"mg_des_cp","QuestionID":"QID23","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If you report a match, you receive \u00a31.20 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receiv...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"condition","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"cp","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">condition<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> cp <\/span>"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_893RCDpKw0JqGk6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID24","SecondaryAttribute":"If you report a match, you receive \u00a31.20 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receiv..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If you report a match, you receive &pound;1.20 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receive &pound;0.20.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>We expect you to follow the rule of this task and report truthfully<\/strong>. You should report a match if, and only if, you actually obtain one.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAs mentioned earlier, you are part of a group of around 1,000 participants completing this task. Given how the task works, it is very unlikely that more than 25% of this group will obtain a match. If more than 25% report a match, this is likely due to <strong>some participants breaking the rule and reporting a match when they did not obtain one<\/strong>.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"mg_des_norm","QuestionID":"QID24","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If you report a match, you receive \u00a31.20 from this task. If you do not report a match, you receiv...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"condition","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"norm","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">condition<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> norm <\/span>"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_893RCDpKw0JqGk6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID25","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the above carefully before going to the next page. We will ask a few questions to mak...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please read the above carefully before going to the next page. We will ask a few questions to make sure that you understand the task.","DataExportTag":"mg_des_proceed","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the above carefully before going to the next page. We will ask a few questions to mak...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I understand the task well. I'd like to proceed."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswe